{"id":"620928","name":"蒜蓉鸡爪","author":"笑笑昵","authorId":"10878013","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/620928/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡爪","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材:鸡爪剪去指甲、蒜和小米椒切末、姜片。","img":"images/620928/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡爪冷水下锅，放入姜片和料酒焯水。","img":"images/620928/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"捞岀。","img":"images/620928/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"冲去血沫，沥干水份。","img":"images/620928/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中油热放入姜片煸香。","img":"images/620928/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入鸡爪翻炒几下。","img":"images/620928/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入盐。","img":"images/620928/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入生抽。","img":"images/620928/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入老抽。","img":"images/620928/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入蚝油。","img":"images/620928/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入胡椒粉。","img":"images/620928/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放少许的料酒。","img":"images/620928/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"翻炒几下。","img":"images/620928/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入高压锅蒸格，上汽压八分钟。","img":"images/620928/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"锅中油热放入蒜蓉和小米椒炒香。","img":"images/620928/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入蒸好的鸡爪翻炒均匀。","img":"images/620928/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放入少许的白糖提鲜。","img":"images/620928/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/620928/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/620928/step_19.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}